mkpdf is an independent, clean-room implementation. It was developed from public
standards and specifications (ISO 32000-1 and ISO 32000-2, and referenced standards).
It does not contain code copied or adapted from other PDF libraries.

Third-party components that are redistributed with mkpdf, and their notices, are listed in
docs/dependencies.md. At the time of writing there are none.
